# Shop-Books web (Vite) configuration — LOCAL DEVELOPMENT.
# Copy to web/.env.local (gitignored) only if you need to override something.
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser bundle and are PUBLIC: anyone who loads the site
# can read them. NEVER put secrets, passwords, session secrets or database URLs here.

# Where the Shop-Books API is. Leave EMPTY for local development: the app then calls the same-origin
# "/api/v1" and the Vite dev server proxies it to http://localhost:3000.
# A deployed build must set it (the build fails on Vercel without it): see .env.staging.example.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Bill photo/PDF attachments are POSTPONED (docs/bill-attachments-postponed.md). Leave unset (off).
# "enabled" turns the upload UI and offline attachment queue back on; only together with an API
# whose DOCUMENT_STORAGE_DRIVER is "agent" or "local".
# VITE_BILL_ATTACHMENTS=
